to effect movement of lines,
or with
.I yank
to effect duplication of lines.
If no
.I buffer
is specified, then the last
.I deleted
or
.I yanked
text is restored.*
.FS
* But no modifying commands may intervene between the
.I delete
or
.I yank
and the
